Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y):
This branch predates the should_clear_shared_image_ bookkeeping the
upstream raster_decoder.cc hunk relies on, so it was added to mirror the
M152 code: a `bool should_clear_shared_image_ = false;` member in
RasterDecoderImpl, DoBeginRasterCHROMIUM() sets it instead of calling
SetCleared() (the following DCHECK(IsCleared()) is removed as upstream
did), and DoEndRasterCHROMIUM() captures the FlushWriteAccess() result,
only calls shared_image_->SetCleared() when the flush succeeded, and
resets the flag when the raster ends.

